<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>CiviDoc — document management for growing firms</title>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>CiviDoc</h1>
    <p>Secure document management and invoicing for professional-services firms.
       Every tenant's contracts, invoices and documents in one place.</p>

    <h2>Sign in</h2>
    <p><a href="{{ path('portal_login') }}">Portal sign in</a> for your team.</p>

    <h2>For developers</h2>
    <p>CiviDoc exposes a small JSON API for integrations:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><code>GET /api/invoices/{id}</code> — fetch an invoice</li>
        <li><code>GET /api/documents?id={id}</code> — fetch a document record</li>
        <li><code>GET /portal/documents/download?file={name}</code> — download a stored document</li>
    </ul>

    <footer>
        <p><small>CiviDoc Platform · built on Symfony</small></p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
